        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As of December 31, 2025, we had 5,261 full-time employees, of whom approximately 54% are in engineering roles involved in the design, development, support, and manufacture of new and existing products and processes.",
