        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Given the breadth of our product offerings, we also compete with companies that develop products or otherwise operate in the mobile, camera, consumer hardware, communication, content, and advertising industries that offer, or will offer, products and services that may compete with Snapchat features or offerings.",
