        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to our core Snapchat product, we offer Snapchat+, Lens+, and Snapchat Platinum, our subscription services that provide subscribers access to exclusive, experimental, and pre-release features.",
